WEBVTT

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:50.500
Ulgar!

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:56.410
It's real...

00:01:56.410 --> 00:01:59.160
How does he have a gun?

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:01.290
Is it settled then?

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:04.540
Is he really the enemy?

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:06.500
Give me the gun, Ulgar.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.750
This is mine. I'm never giving it up.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:10.910
Kanata...

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:12.450
I know.

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:17.620
In this isolated environment,
the one with the gun makes the laws.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:21.700
Don't be stupid. I don't want to be king.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.500
Also, not that it matters, but...

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.160
...I'm not the enemy.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.750
Then why?!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.950
It's personal.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:33.080
Luca, you're going to die.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:36.160
A grudge against me?! Please explain!

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.950
This is messed up!

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:40.370
I thought we were friends!

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:49.000
Take your complaints to your father,
Marco Esposito.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.200
My dad? You have a grudge against my dad?

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.660
Luca's father is...

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.700
A senator, I think.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:00.160
I've been chasing after Marco Esposito
for the longest time.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.870
Trying to kill him.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:06.410
I had a brother, five years older than me.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:15.160
Everyone loved my brother but shunned me.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:19.870
Both in and outside my family,
I was treated like I didn't exist.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:26.870
But I have this personality. I didn't mind
being neglected. I enjoyed being alone.

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:30.330
My brother, though, was different.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:36.580
He treated me kindly. He was the only one.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.370
He became a freelance journalist.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:43.330
He went after politicians and big
companies, and their dirty deals.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.370
I looked up to him.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.950
I started to want to become
a journalist like him.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.040
Ulgar, is there anything you want?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.370
Huh?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.500
Not really.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.910
Wow, you're boring.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.450
Teen years are fleeting, Ulgar.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:16.160
You can be a shiny teen or a dull teen.
Either way, it's over when you're 20.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.000
After that, it's all up to you.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.580
Think about what kind of life you want to live.

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:26.040
Those that don't think get left behind.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.540
I want a cap.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.290
Huh?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.540
I want to be like you.

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:37.500
One day, he died. He fell off a building.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.660
Police ruled it a suicide.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:45.500
He did mention several times
that he had worries about work, but...

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.830
I got myself mixed up in
something worse than I thought.

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:51.540
Not that I intend to pull out now, of course.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.370
The prime target he was after at the time

00:04:56.370 --> 00:05:00.660
was Marco Esposito, and some
alleged campaign donation violations.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.330
My brother would never commit suicide.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:12.500
Why would anyone buy a birthday
present for their little brother,

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.450
then kill themselves a few days
before the birthday?!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.250
Your father killed my brother.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.500
Do you have proof?

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.870
If I did, I would have accused him in public!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.830
Any comments, Luca?

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.410
I don't have trouble imagining
my dad doing that.

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.500
Luca!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.660
I vowed to avenge my brother.

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:46.950
To kill Marco, I trained in marksmanship
using a training gun.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.410
I shot and shot and shot.

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:53.790
It was weird. I felt relaxed while shooting.

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:59.790
My revenge was the closest thing I had
to a goal in this trash heap of a life.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.700
What a life...

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:07.160
But it isn't easy to get a gun these days.

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:12.410
I'd have to steal one from the police,
or enter the underworld...

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:15.450
But then, I came across this--

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:18.790
a gun in the storage area aboard the <i>Astra</i>.

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:25.580
It's destiny. The gun showed me that
revenge is the way I must take.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:29.040
Getting on the same team
as you was also destiny.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:34.450
The Espositos are hereditary politicians.
They pass their power down to their sons.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.330
Luca is the eldest son.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.950
Marco will feel how painful it is
to lose a precious family member!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.790
Stop, Ulgar!

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:48.790
We're companions! We can share the pain!

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.410
You know this, Ulgar!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.290
I don't have companions!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:55.160
My brother is the only one
who could understand me!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:07:00.790
He wasn't like me.
He was strong and kind...

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.160
He showed me the light!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:09.450
Why did he have to die...?

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.040
I was the worthless one.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:17.120
I wish it were you.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.370
I'm not even loved!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.330
Please die, Luca...!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.040
It's useless.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:29.000
I'm just like you, Ulgar.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.370
I'm not loved either.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.750
What?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.620
I'm not the heir to the Esposito family.

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:39.830
My little brother is the one my dad
wants to pass his power on to.

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.790
Killing me won't make my dad sad.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:48.040
Lies! You're lying to save your life!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.790
I have proof.

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:52.250
Proof?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.950
Luca...

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:05.200
You're...

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.200
...a girl...?

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.410
Luca?!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.200
What is this?! An earthquake?!

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.080
I'm scared!

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.250
We're safe! We're outside!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.540
I'm not completely female.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.500
Or completely male.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:31.750
Intersex...

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:40.080
Intersexual, meaning not medically
completely male or female.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:47.290
I was raised as a male.
I felt a little different at times.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:51.040
But I only found out
when we checked in a hospital.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:55.540
I am both male and female.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.580
Physically... Well, you saw.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:02.750
A lot of shapes are unclear.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.870
Did Marco... Did you parents know
from the beginning?

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.950
No, we found out at
the same time at the hospital.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:14.790
He would never have brought me in
if he knew I was intersex.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.910
What?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.790
I'm adopted.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.830
What?!

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.330
Adopted?!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.830
Stop lying!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:27.040
It's true. I can prove it when we get home.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:30.370
My parents had a hard time having kids.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:33.120
They needed an heir, so they brought me in.

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:37.040
Something about an artist they knew
that couldn't raise their child.

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:43.700
Luca is adopted, too...? Like Funi?

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:47.370
Many of us have issues with our parents.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:50.410
Is that the common element connecting us?

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:55.620
But later, my brother was born,
and we found out about my intersexuality.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:59.200
Dad's interest shifted
to my brother right away.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.160
Why did you hide it?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.870
I wasn't hiding it.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:08.250
I'm registered as a male,
and identify as a male too.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.040
However, I can't imagine how I'm
going to change from here on.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:18.200
But no matter what, I am who I am.
I don't treat it like a big problem.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:22.950
But my dad... The Esposito family is different.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:26.330
If I'm not a man, I'm not fit to be the heir.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.000
Killing me won't make my dad sad.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.870
That's impossible!
What kind of parent would...

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:40.700
Yes. You of all people should know
how I feel about this...

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:44.080
You can shoot me, but it won't help.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.700
But if it makes my dad sad...

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:48.500
...I would be glad.

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:55.040
Ulgar.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.000
Ulgar, follow me.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:03.870
Check it out.

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:09.500
This is my secret spot. When I'm
feeling down, I come here to shout.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:12.660
Nobody can hear us here.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:16.750
There, it's a headwind. Shout, Ulgar!

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.160
Shout!

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:20.660
Dammit...

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.910
Dammit!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.870
Discord with our parents...
Is that the common thread?

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:40.950
No, it can't be...
That's no reason to get us all killed.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.580
Besides, some of us have loving parents.

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:46.790
What is it then?
What is our common connection...?

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.080
Everyone, get on the ship!

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.370
What is it?!

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.620
Extend the gangway!

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.330
Luca, Ulgar, get over here!

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:11.500
A wave's coming!

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:21.580
Luca! Ulgar! Hurry!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:52.200
Kanata!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.580
Luca and Ulgar got
washed away by the tsunami!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:58.370
Tsunami... From the earthquake?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.410
Zack! Lower the ship!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.450
I'm going to fly as close
to the surface as possible!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.120
Find them from the gangway!
The sun's coming down soon!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.410
Ulgar!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:32.410
Well, hello there, Mr. Ulgar. We've got
ourselves in a bit of tight spot, eh?

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.200
Hey, let me go!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:38.660
Your arm can't hold on!

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:43.500
Don't underestimate me.
I'm not about to give up on a companion.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:48.580
I'm no companion! I tried to kill you!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:51.370
Still going on about that?

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:55.870
Shut up, wannabe lone wolf!
Quit yapping and hold on!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:03.660
Kanata talked about the time
he got lost in the mountains,

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.910
and how he lacked the strength
to save his teacher.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:12.120
I'm not adding us to that list of regrets!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:19.000
Ulgar! Ulgar!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:41.450
Ugh, that hurts... My abs...

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:46.080
Are you okay, Kanata?!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:50.200
My abs and arms are getting torn apart.
Pull me up, fast!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.250
Luca! Can you hold on a bit longer?!

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:55.500
I'm fine!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.700
Take care of that show-off first!

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.370
Whoa.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.660
Sorry, but I don't have any strength left.

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:11.250
Do what you have to do.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:13.500
Don't underestimate me...

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:16.580
I never want to feel that way again...

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:20.790
That's why I've been lifting
weights this whole time!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.620
You did well.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.870
Yeah, he's awesome.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.580
I apologize.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:51.290
I tried to kill you, and I forced you
to reveal your secret.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:55.410
I made you... get naked...
in front of everyone...

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:02.120
What did you say? I couldn't hear you.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:05.290
I, um... made you get naked...

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:08.580
He's taking advantage of
Ulgar's guilt to pick on him.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:12.700
Don't worry about it. It doesn't bother me.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:18.790
In fact, it was a good opportunity
to let me talk about myself. But...

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:23.080
If what my dad did got your brother killed,

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.160
it's me who needs to apologize.

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:30.330
We're similar, you and me.
I understand how you feel.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.700
No, not just me.

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.790
We all have issues of some sort.

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:39.000
That's what makes us all
capable of empathy.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.750
You're not alone.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:45.910
Luca's father is not off the hook.

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:48.450
When I get back, I'm going to
investigate him thoroughly,

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:50.830
and prepare to accuse him
of whatever it is that he did.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:55.040
To do that, I'm going home
in one piece. All of us, together.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.250
Yeah!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.410
Let's be friends, Ulgar.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:04.580
Guys, can I have a moment?
There's something on my mind...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.910
Would a politician kill someone
just to hide a corruption problem?

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:13.080
Politicians are accused of
that kind of stuff all the time.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:18.620
If Ulgar's brother was killed,
wouldn't it be for some other reason?

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:24.910
Like, maybe when he was investigating
Marco Esposito, he found something bigger?

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:30.450
I got myself mixed up in something
worse than I thought.

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:33.830
You mean, he found something
worse than campaign finance...

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:39.410
Like, something related to us
getting lost in space like this?

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.370
The "enemy" among us
is just the perpetrator.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:49.910
There has to be someone who set
the whole thing up and gave the orders.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:55.250
Don't let the adults fool you, Ulgar.

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:59.790
They're all lying.
I'm going to become a journalist,

00:17:59.790 --> 00:18:02.370
and bust all the lies in this world.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:11.370
Here's the gun. It got wet,
but it's still usable.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.870
You hold on to it.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.830
Me?! But I...

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:18.080
No buts.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.790
You're the only one who can shoot that thing.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:25.080
You're in charge of the gun.
I'm counting on you, Ulgar!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.910
I'm counting on you, Ulgar!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.410
Aye, yeah.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:40.450
Team B5, camp log.

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:43.830
After narrowly escaping
the wave on Arispade,

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:48.160
we decided to take off for
the fourth planet right away.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:54.080
This incident gave us a chance
to talk about ourselves more.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:57.950
The trip is long, but not boring.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:03.870
Ulgar is still not talkative, but he's
obviously different from before.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:07.910
We treat Luca as a boy, like before.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.750
Let's do a round of Sumo wrestling!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.450
--But sometimes the boys in the team
seem to feel a bit awkward.
--Really? Nah...

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:13.330
--But sometimes the boys in the team
seem to feel a bit awkward.
--What? Come on!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:18.580
I, for one, feel a bit like I have a new
female friend, which I'm glad about.

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:21.620
You. Stop messing with...

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:26.160
Please, don't mind me...

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.750
Luca is picking on Ulgar again.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:33.500
Luca's the one that brings it up the most.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:38.500
It seems like Luca enjoyed
letting it all out.

00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:41.250
We're all on good terms!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.620
"Day 20 on the ship
Day 71 of being lost in space"

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.080
Ouch! I cut myself.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.040
What?!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.370
Oh, it's nothing.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.250
Come on, show me.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:57.700
Good, it's not deep.
I'll put a bandage on it.

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:00.450
Make sure you show Quitterie later.

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.120
I said I'm fine!

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:05.200
Oh, I'm sorry I grabbed
your hand without asking.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.540
Oh, no, it's okay. I'm embarrassed...

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:10.080
Oh, wow, that was loud! I'm embarrassed!

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:12.910
You know, Charce, you're...

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:17.790
You're really nice to Aries,
like always watching out for her.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:23.080
I'm nice to everyone.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:26.160
Well, yeah, but would you say
that about yourself?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:31.250
It's like you're giving Aries special
treatment. What is it? What?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.000
I'll leave that up to your imagination.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.120
Oh! Scandalous! Did you hear that?

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:39.620
Delicious.

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:44.790
Charce, what classes do you take?

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:48.410
I want to learn more about you!

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.410
Yeah, you go get him, Aries!

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:52.370
A love triangle in the making!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:55.500
I want to learn about Charce, too!

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:57.450
This guy is so clueless.

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:00.950
Is he stupid? And what is he eating?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:04.080
Charce must be taking biology.

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:07.500
Is it true that the biology teacher
wears a hairpiece?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:12.120
I do take biology, but I don't know
about the teacher's hairpiece.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:17.830
Oh, I take biology too. And the hairpiece
only covers the top of his head.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.870
What are you even talking about?

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:25.410
There's only one biology class, so you
two must have been in the same class.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.290
I didn't notice at all.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:30.750
Of course, you didn't know each other
until you met here at camp.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.910
Oh, but I...

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.660
What's wrong, Aries?

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.450
This is strange.

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:40.450
I don't remember you, Charce.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:46.540
No, and neither do I. Who would remember
someone they've never even talked to?

00:21:46.540 --> 00:21:49.000
I would.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:52.250
I remember the faces of everyone
I share a class with.

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:56.330
I have a photographic memory.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:02.830
I went to biology class many times after
I transferred in, before leaving for camp.

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:08.250
I made a conscious effort to remember
everyone's faces, so I'm certain.

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:12.040
I have no doubt that Charce
was not in that class.

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:15.410
Charce, are you...

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:17.330
Are you hiding something?
